# Experiment A: the baseline with the per-step token budget raised from 2048
# to 8192, the value vLLM 0.29.0 itself picks for the API server on cards of
# 70 GB and up (vllm/engine/arg_utils.py). Everything else is as baseline.
# Hypothesis and result: docs/03-results.md, wiki/log.md.
ENGINE_ARGS=--gpu-memory-utilization 0.90 --max-model-len 8192 --max-num-seqs 256 --max-num-batched-tokens 8192
